<title>UK: Dixie Toga prices $77 mln eight-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Dixie Toga prices $77 mln eight-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian Dixie Toga SA has priced a $77 million eight-year Eurobond to pay a coupon of 9.5625 percent, lead manager Indosuez Capital said on Monday.</p>
<p> AMT    $77 MLN	 COUPON     9.5625    MATURITY   *14.MAR.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.78     PAY DATE    14.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    99.78     SPREAD	+325 BP</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 100+10    LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.25	GOV LAW     NEW YORK</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND EIGHT-YEAR INTERPOLATED U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALLABLE AND PUTTABLE IN YEAR FIVE AT PAR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
